218 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (If you're constantly drained, overwhelmed, or saying yes when you want to say no, this guide is your sanctuary. Boundaries are not just lines drawn between you and others; they are essentials that carve space for self-respect, mental clarity, and wholehearted living. Imagine your energy as a finite resource. Imagine what a difference it would make if you could steward it wisely. This is your roadmap to protect your energy, prioritize your well-being, and live with intention. Let's embark on this journey together.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
219 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (In the following chapters, you'll discover why boundaries matter, how to recognize your energy leaks, and practical tools to craft a personalized blueprint for balance. Each chapter includes real-world examples, reflective exercises, scripts for assertive communication, and space for you to journal your unique experiences.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
220 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/E (By the end of this book, you will have a clearer sense of your worth, the confidence to say no without guilt, and a plan to reclaim your energy, so you can show up fully, every day.)
/Pg 8 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
